        "sentence": "On 2026-08-14, The New York Times reported “About a month after President Trump sharply reduced the size of two national monuments in Utah, at least nine mining claims have been staked on land that is no longer protected from development, public records show.”; on the same day, The New York Times reported “Steve Bloch, the legal director at the Southern Utah Wilderness Alliance, a nonprofit environmental group that first noticed the nine new claims, said he worried that mining would damage the fragile desert landscape.”."
